Subject: [PATCH 26/34] [3.1.1] [M156] [sync] Validate preference source for
 kLocalSyncBackendDir

Original change's description:
> [sync] Validate preference source for kLocalSyncBackendDir
>
> Local sync backend directory preference (kLocalSyncBackendDir) is
> intended to be configured exclusively via enterprise policy or
> command-line flags. Previously,
> ChromeSyncClient::GetLocalSyncBackendFolder() read this preference
> directly from PrefService without verifying the backing preference
> store.
>
> Update ChromeSyncClient::GetLocalSyncBackendFolder() to only honor
> kLocalSyncBackendDir when set via mandatory policy or command-line
> switches, ignoring values from user-modifiable, extension, or custodian
> preference stores.
